* VALID_SHELL_CMD(cmd)
* Return @true if cmd has no shell metacharacters unsafe for OS.EXECUTE.
* Copyright (c) String Database
*
* START-DESCRIPTION:
*
*    x = !valid_shell_cmd(cmd)
*
*    Allows spaces for normal commands (e.g. "ls -la") but rejects command
*    chaining/substitution characters and embedded newlines.
*
* END-DESCRIPTION
*
* START-CODE

$internal
function valid_shell_cmd(cmd)
$catalog !valid_shell_cmd

   * Modified by Composer AI - 2026/06/10.
   * Reject empty commands and shell chaining/substitution metacharacters.
   if cmd = '' then return @false
   if index(char(10), cmd, 1) or index(char(13), cmd, 1) then return @false
   shell.meta = ';|&$`<>'
   if convert(shell.meta, '', cmd) # cmd then return @false
   * --------------------
   return @true

end

* END-CODE
